---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AlpineDiagram from '../components/AlpineDiagram.astro';
import { path } from '../lib/urls';
---
<BaseLayout title="Media" description="Approved visuals and development snapshots for Project Gotthard, with clear labels for artwork and gameplay."><div class="container page-content"><header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Visual archive / 02</p><h1>From inside the mountain.</h1><p class="lead">Screenshots, work in progress and artwork, hopefully with context.</p></header><div class="notice">Gameplay screenshots have not been published here yet since it consist mostly of AI-Placeholders right now.</div><div class="media-drawing"><AlpineDiagram /></div><div class="prose"><h2>Alpine survey illustration</h2><p><strong>Website artwork.</strong> An AI-Created vector schematic created for The Gotthard Files. It's here because I needed something as a placeholder; it does not depict an in-game location or interface.</p><p>Credit: Project Gotthard website. No third-party imagery or game assets are used in this illustration.</p><a class="text-link" href={path('devlog/')}>Read the development journal →</a></div></div></BaseLayout>
